              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa makĩtulũla makunia moo, sisya, kyove kya mbesa kya kĩla mũndũ kyaĩ nthĩnĩ wa ĩkunia yake: nao na ĩthe woo, yĩla moonie syove syoo sya mbesa, makĩa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
